<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34972" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-frŭor</span></b> , ctus, 3,
			v. dep.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>to</i>
			
			
			<i>enjoy fully</i> or <i>thoroughly</i>
			(class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With
				abl.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">his ego rebus pascor, his delector, his
					perfruor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Pis. 20, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laetitiā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Cat. 1, 10, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">salvā re publicā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 6, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sapientiae laude,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Brut. 2, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitā modicā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Leg. 1, 21, 56</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">otio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fam. 7, 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">recordatione urbis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell. 2, 101, 3 al.</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amoenitate summā perfructus est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Hort. p. 484</span></i>
			 Orell.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b> In <i>pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad perfruendas voluptates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Off. 1, 8, 25</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to fulfil</i>, <i>perform</i> (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mandatis perfruar ipsa patris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					H. 11, 128</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
